5,0,1,talk,Minato,,"Hello everyone! I'm a bit nervous, but I'm looking forward to playing with you all. Let's try to get along and find the werewolf together!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. Let us maintain a calm and rational atmosphere; logic shall be our greatest ally in uncovering the wolf among us.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Servas,,Greetings to you all. It is a joy to be in such spirited company. Let us approach this challenge with patience and a kind heart; wisdom often reveals what haste overlooks.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,May,,"Hi everyone! I'm May. Let's make this game exciting! I'll be watching you all very closely, so try not to be too obvious with your lies, okay?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm ready! I don't care who the werewolf is, I'm going to find them and protect everyone. Let's just get started and see who starts acting weird!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, you sound so confident! I wonder how you'll tell if someone is lying. I want to learn how to do that too!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Observation is key, Minato. One must look for inconsistencies in logic and subtle shifts in demeanor. Though, on this first day, we are merely observing the baseline of everyone's behavior.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, Benjamin. There is a certain beauty in the beginning, where all possibilities remain open. Let us listen to one another with an open mind and see what truths emerge from our conversation.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, it's all about the vibes! A little slip of the tongue or a nervous laugh usually gives it away. I've got a good eye for these things, so just stay close to me!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"Vibes aren't everything, May! We need real proof. I'm not just going to trust a ""feeling""—I'll be watching for anyone who tries to hide or act too suspicious. I've got this!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, you're so brave! I'll try my best to help you find the proof. I hope we can all be friends while we play this game.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"While friendship is a noble sentiment, Minato, we must remember that one of us is wearing a mask. A gentle heart is wonderful, provided it does not blind us to the cold reality of the game.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Benjamin speaks a hard truth, yet there is no conflict between kindness and vigilance. We can support one another while remaining mindful. Let us find a balance that preserves our spirit and our safety.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, you're such a killjoy! Let's not get too gloomy just yet. A little bit of flirting and fun makes the game better, don't you think? I'm sure we can find the wolf and still have a blast!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"Stop talking about flirting, May! This is a serious game. We're here to catch a werewolf, not have a party. I'm staying focused, and you should too if you actually want to win!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minato,,I think it's okay to have fun and be serious at the same time! I'll just listen to everyone and try my best. I hope we can all be happy tomorrow.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Minato,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,I believe we have established a sufficient baseline for today. I shall spend the remaining time in quiet contemplation of our interactions.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Servas,,"It has been a wonderful first exchange. Let us carry this positive energy into the night, trusting that the truth will guide us when the sun rises again. I wish you all a peaceful evening.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,May,,"You're all so stiff! I'm going to keep things lively, even if Takumi wants to be a grumpy guard dog. Goodnight, everyone! Sweet dreams... if you can!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not a guard dog, I'm just the only one taking this seriously! I'll be watching everyone tomorrow, so don't think you can trick me.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
