36,1,1,talk,Minato,,"Good morning, everyone! I hope you all slept well. Did anything happen last night? I'm a little scared, but I'm ready to hear what everyone thinks!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Good morning. As the sun rises, so does the need for clarity. I have spent the night seeking the truth, and I believe it is time to share my findings with the village.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a bright new morning. Benjamin, you sound as though you have discovered something of importance. Please, share your wisdom with us; we are all listening with great interest.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,May,,"Oh, look at Benjamin being all mysterious! You've got a secret, don't you? Come on, don't keep us in suspense—tell us who you've been spying on! I'm dying to know!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Just get to the point, Benjamin! If you found something, tell us right now. We don't have time for all this mysterious talk—who is the werewolf?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Benjamin, you're the Seer, aren't you? That's so cool! Please tell us what you found. I hope it's someone we can talk to and understand!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, Minato, I am the Seer. I divined Takumi last night, and I can confirm that he is human. While this does not identify the wolf, it provides us with a reliable foundation of trust.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Servas,,"That is a most comforting revelation, Benjamin. To have a foundation of trust in Takumi is a gift to us all. It allows us to narrow our focus and move forward with a lighter heart.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, how generous of you to clear Takumi so quickly! But now the real question is: who's left? Since Takumi is safe, the wolf must be hiding among the rest of us. Any other hunches, Seer?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"Wait, you checked me? Why waste a turn on me when you could've found the wolf! But fine, at least now you know I'm on your side. Now tell us who you're suspicious of, Benjamin!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Minato,,"@Benjamin, thank you for helping us! Since Takumi is human, it makes me feel a little safer. But I'm still worried... who do you think we should look at next? I don't want to pick the wrong person.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"While I cannot divine another player this instant, I find May's eagerness to shift the focus quite intriguing. Her ""vibes"" are a curious metric, though perhaps a bit too convenient for someone wishing to deflect suspicion.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It is natural for the young to be spirited, Benjamin, but your observation is a gentle reminder to stay mindful. May, your energy is a light in this room, but perhaps we should all reflect on our intentions.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, how cold! You're actually trying to turn the table on me just because I'm having fun? That's a classic move to distract everyone. I'm just being my usual charming self, not a wolf!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, you're actually onto something! May's been acting way too playful while we're trying to solve this. If you're the Seer and you're suspicious of her, we should listen. May, stop joking around and give us a real answer!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Minato,,"@May, please don't be sad! I'm sure you're just being yourself. But @Benjamin is the Seer, so maybe we should listen to him? I don't want anyone to be angry, but we have to find the werewolf.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Logic dictates that we prioritize the Seer's intuition when evidence is scarce. May's deflection is predictable, but in this game, predictability is often a mask. I suggest we consider her for execution today.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Servas,,"It is a heavy burden to decide the fate of a companion. While May's spirit is bright, we must weigh the Seer's logic against our feelings. Let us decide with a clear mind and a peaceful heart.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, you're really going for it, huh? Using your ""logic"" to paint me as the villain just because I'm not as stiff as you. It's almost too easy! I'm a villager, and you're just bored. Don't let him trick you, everyone!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not falling for that, May! You're just trying to make Benjamin look like the bad guy because he's calling you out. If the Seer says you're suspicious, I'm with him. I'm voting for May!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
