69,2,1,talk,Minato,,Oh no... Benjamin is gone! I can't believe it. I feel so sad that we lost the Seer so quickly. Who could have done something so mean? I'm really scared now.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a tragedy to lose such a refined mind so soon. Benjamin's departure leaves a void in our guidance, but we must not let grief cloud our vision. Let us honor his memory by remaining steadfast and calm.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"This is a disaster! The werewolf killed the Seer because they were scared of him! That just proves Benjamin was right about May, or that the wolf is someone else who's terrified of the truth. We can't just be sad—we have to find them now!","{""words"":45,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, you're right, we have to be brave. But it's so scary... since Benjamin is gone, we don't have anyone to tell us the truth anymore. Do you think the werewolf is someone who was acting very quiet?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Servas,,"Quietness can be a sanctuary for the weary, Minato, but it can also be a cloak for the cunning. However, let us not rush to judgment. We must look at the patterns of our hearts and words.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, being quiet doesn't mean they're the wolf, but it doesn't mean they're innocent either. We have to look at who benefits from Benjamin being dead. The wolf wanted him gone because he was the only one who could prove things!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, that's true... the werewolf must be very scary to kill the Seer. I want to help you find them, but I'm worried I might make a mistake. @Servas, do you think anyone's heart feels different today?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Servas,,"My dear Minato, the heart is a subtle instrument. While I feel no sudden discord, I notice that Takumi's spirit is burning with a very intense fire today. Such passion is admirable, but we must ensure it is guided by truth, not just desperation.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, my ""fire"" is because we're losing! We can't just sit around talking about hearts while the werewolf is still among us. I'm not desperate, I'm focused! We have to figure out who's lying before it's too late!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Minato,,"I don't want anyone to fight... but @Takumi is right that we have to be careful. I'm just a little confused. If we can't trust our feelings, how will we ever find the werewolf? I'll vote for whoever you think is most suspicious.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Servas,,"It is a delicate path we walk, Minato. When the light of the Seer is extinguished, we must rely on the steady rhythm of our own intuition and the honesty of our companions. Let us breathe and seek the truth together.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, don't just follow me! You have to think for yourself too! @Servas, your intuition is too slow for this. It's either you or Minato. I'm not letting the wolf win just because we're being ""peaceful""! I'm voting for the one who's most suspicious!","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
